        "narrative": "Danna always shares Mattea's point of view because he is loyal to his friend. Danna never questions Mattea's decisions and always stands by his side, no matter what the situation is.",
        "speakers": [
          "Danna",
          "Mattea"
        ],
        "behaviors": [
          {
            "utterance_length": 2,
            "filler_words": 0,
            "backchannels": 0,
            "interruptions": 2
          },
          {
            "utterance_length": 1,
            "filler_words": 0,
            "backchannels": 0,
            "interruptions": 0
          }
        ],
        "num_turns": 10,
        "utterances": [
          {
            "uttr_idx": 0,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "I'm thinking about ways we can improve our team collaboration to boost productivity. We need to focus on",
            "dur_samples": 173568,
            "start_time": 0.0,
            "end_time": 7.87156462585034,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 1,
            "uttr_type": "interrupt",
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "Communication strategies that ensure everyone is on the same page and understands their roles clearly.",
            "dur_samples": 124035,
            "start_time": 7.419047619047619,
            "end_time": 13.04421768707483,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 2,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "Yes, exactly.",
            "dur_samples": 32393,
            "start_time": 13.544172335600907,
            "end_time": 15.013242630385488,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 3,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "If we can ensure every team member is aligned with our goals, it would make a big difference.",
            "dur_samples": 157696,
            "start_time": 15.013242630385488,
            "end_time": 22.16498866213152,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 4,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "Absolutely, Mattea.",
            "dur_samples": 26180,
            "start_time": 22.36580498866213,
            "end_time": 23.553106575963717,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 5,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "It's crucial to have alignment. One idea is to hold weekly meetings where we could discuss each member's progress and challenges they're facing. It would help us keep track of everything.",
            "dur_samples": 266240,
            "start_time": 23.553106575963717,
            "end_time": 35.627482993197276,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 6,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "That could work well.",
            "dur_samples": 33729,
            "start_time": 36.166167800453515,
            "end_time": 37.69582766439909,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 7,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "Another thought is to use tools that allow for more transparent project management, so everyone knows what's happening at all times.",
            "dur_samples": 181504,
            "start_time": 37.69582766439909,
            "end_time": 45.927301587301585,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 8,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "Definitely.",
            "dur_samples": 14916,
            "start_time": 46.24362811791383,
            "end_time": 46.920090702947846,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 9,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "Implementing such tools can provide visibility into the tasks and deadlines, which is essential for efficient project management. It would also help in identifying bottlenecks early on.",
            "dur_samples": 235008,
            "start_time": 46.920090702947846,
            "end_time": 57.578049886621315,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 10,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "Right, and once we address these, the workflow should become smoother. We should also consider providing feedback sessions so",
            "dur_samples": 261588,
            "start_time": 57.661133786848076,
            "end_time": 69.52453514739229,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 11,
            "uttr_type": "interrupt",
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "Everyone has an opportunity to voice their opinions and contribute to improving the process.",
            "dur_samples": 96324,
            "start_time": 69.1069387755102,
            "end_time": 73.47537414965987,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 12,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "Yes, I believe regular feedback sessions would foster a more open environment.",
            "dur_samples": 129211,
            "start_time": 73.9950566893424,
            "end_time": 79.85496598639456,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 13,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 1,
            "speaker": "Mattea",
            "tts_text": "It might encourage innovation from within the team.",
            "dur_samples": 76288,
            "start_time": 79.85496598639456,
            "end_time": 83.31473922902494,
            "backchannels": []
          },
          {
            "uttr_idx": 14,
            "uttr_type": null,
            "speaker_idx": 0,
            "speaker": "Danna",
            "tts_text": "Precisely, Mattea. Encouraging team members to share their ideas can lead to creative solutions and keep everyone motivated.",
            "dur_samples": 182091,
            "start_time": 83.78117913832199,
            "end_time": 92.03927437641724,
